@startuml
title UC01 - Hybrid activation (REVIEW)
left to right direction
actor "CSKH application" as Care
rectangle "Telecom backend" {
 usecase "UC01 Activate subscriber" as A
 usecase "Select available number" as S
 usecase "Automatic random allocation" as R
 usecase "Accept WAITING\nmax24h, explicit consent" as W
 usecase "Validate verified identity\nand caller evidence authority" as V
 usecase "Create Subscriber + MAIN0\nand allocate one number" as C
 usecase "Lookup request outcome" as Q
 usecase "Lookup available numbers" as L
}
Care --> A
Care --> Q
Care --> L
S -|> A
R -|> A
A ..> V : <<include>>
W ..> R : <<extend>>\n[empty pool and consent]
note bottom of C
 Conditional successful completion responsibility.
 Not included unconditionally: WAITING creates no Subscriber.
end note
A -- C : completion responsibility
note bottom of W
 No consent => synchronous FAILED.
 Selected-number conflict never becomes WAITING.
 FIFO + stock signal + recovery60s; deadline not reset.
end note
@enduml
